            {
              "date": "2022-01-01",
              "horse": "Masqool",
              "horse_id": "3048708",
              "race": "MansionBet Proud Partners Of The AWC Handicap (Div I)",
              "race_id": "799411",
              "course": "Southwell (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_10244",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1773",
              "quote": "James (Evans, trainer) said Masqool has come to him from Godolphin and every time he's done a bit of work he's improved. We thought he'd run well last time but we didn't think he'd go that close. And today he built on that. It felt like a long last furlong but he's still improving, it was only his fifth run and I think there will be a lot more fun on grass. He'll get a mile and a quarter - Dougie Costello, jockey."
            }
