              "course": "Musselburgh",
              "course_id": "crs_416",
              "distance_f": "12.5",
              "distance_y": "2744",
              "quote": "She's still quite inexperienced. We thought the track might be a touch on the sharp side so were keen to get Molten Sea into her stride and her rhythm and she's done that and showed a good attitude in the later stages. She gets that trip well and I think going up in trip will be a big help. The second horse quickened by her while she was still a bit green and she's really gone through the line well and galloped out nicely afterwards - Callum Rodriguez, jockey, speaking to Racing TV"
